                                "sense_id": "62f96d7c-d429-3137-b487-bb5e32af9229",
                                "text": "But I was disturbed to find a blot on my conception of the ultra-modern S.N.C.F.—the couchette car offered neither hot water nor, unless I looked in the wrong places, an electric razor point."
